<title>USA: USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</title>
<headline>USDA 7-State and U.S. Cattle on Feed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA cattle on feed, 1,000-plus head feedlots (data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    7 MAJOR STATES --  Pct----1997-----1996     1995</p>
<p> On Feed May 1	   109   8,484    7,758    8,233</p>
<p>During April:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 112   1,286    1,150    1,403</p>
<p> -Marketed		 102   1,638    1,613    1,437</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance  105	68	 65	 61</p>
<p> On Feed April 1	 107   8,904    8,286    8,328</p>
<p>The seven major states are Arizona, California, Colorado, Iowa, Kansas, Nebraska and Texas.  </p>
<p>USDA cattle on feed in the United States (1,000-plus head feedlots, data in 1,000 head):</p>
<p>    U.S. TOTAL --	Pct----1997-----1996</p>
<p> On Feed May 1	   108   9,926    9,173</p>
<p>During April:</p>
<p> -Placed on Feed	 113   1,538    1,364</p>
<p> -Marketed		 100   1,905    1,896</p>
<p> -Other Disappearance   92	98	107</p>
<p> On Feed April 1	 106  10,391    9,812</p>
